# owl-union-of: a small runnable case for EYE RPO rules.
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rpo/owl-unionOf.n3
# Rules: MIT, Jos De Roo; sample data added for this example.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

# Sample data
:Pet owl:unionOf (:Cat :Dog). :milo a :Cat. :fido a :Dog.

# Inference rules
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.

{?C owl:unionOf ?L. ?D list:in ?L. ?X a ?D} => {?X a ?C}.
{?C owl:unionOf ?L. ?D list:in ?L} => {?D rdfs:subClassOf ?C}.
